{"seq":2,"slug":"metering-modes","title":"测光模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/optics-basics/exposure-system/metering-modes","wordCount":1795,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"测光模式\">测光模式</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>测光是相机确定正确曝光的核心决策过程。无论多么先进的传感器，如果曝光错误——信号都被裁切或淹没在噪底中——画质就无从谈起。本文系统解析各种测光模式的算法原理、适用场景与局限性，帮助你在自动测光与手动补偿之间做出精准判断。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;Metering Modes&lt;br/&gt;测光模式&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;Matrix/Evaluative&lt;br/&gt;矩阵测光&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;Center-Weighted&lt;br/&gt;中央重点&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;Spot&lt;br/&gt;点测光&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; E[&quot;Highlight-Weighted&lt;br/&gt;高光加权&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[&quot;Multi-zone analysis&lt;br/&gt;AI scene recognition&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[&quot;60-80% weight on center&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[&quot;1-5% of frame area&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[&quot;Protect highlights&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"Metering Modes&lt;br/&gt;测光模式\"] --&gt; B[\"Matrix/Evaluative&lt;br/&gt;矩阵测光\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"Center-Weighted&lt;br/&gt;中央重点\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"Spot&lt;br/&gt;点测光\"]\n    A --&gt; E[\"Highlight-Weighted&lt;br/&gt;高光加权\"]\n    B --&gt; B1[\"Multi-zone analysis&lt;br/&gt;AI scene recognition\"]\n    C --&gt; C1[\"60-80% weight on center\"]\n    D --&gt; D1[\"1-5% of frame area\"]\n    E --&gt; E1[\"Protect highlights\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>测光是相机把物理光量转化为曝光决策的过程，各模式的区别在于&quot;测哪里&quot;与&quot;如何加权&quot;：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>测光基准</strong>：所有测光系统假设场景平均反射率为 18% 中性灰，在雪地、黑猫等极端场景会导致系统性欠曝或过曝。</li>\n<li><strong>反射式 vs 入射式</strong>：相机内置均为反射式，测的是&quot;物体看起来有多亮&quot;，会被被摄体反射率影响。</li>\n<li><strong>四种模式的取舍</strong>：矩阵测光分区加权、适应大多数场景；中央重点测光可预测、适合视频；点测光最精确、配合 Zone System 使用；高光加权测光专为保护高光设计。</li>\n<li><strong>辅助手段</strong>：AE-L 用于先测光再构图，曝光补偿用于批次偏亮/偏暗，包围曝光用于不确定光线或 HDR 合成。</li>\n<li><strong>失准预判</strong>：理解每种模式的算法假设，就能预判它在高反差、特殊反射率条件下何时失效并提前补偿。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"测光的物理基础\">测光的物理基础</h2><h3 id=\"18-灰-测光基准\">18% 灰——测光基准</h3><p>所有测光系统都假设场景的平均反射率为 18%（中性灰）。18% 灰对应的反射率使得在标准照明下，测光表给出的曝光值能让该灰度正确还原。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.18</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{gray} = 0.18 \\cdot E_{illumination} / \\pi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.18</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">mina</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这一假设在大多数自然场景中成立（森林、城市街景等统计平均确实接近 18%），但在极端场景（雪地、黑猫）中会导致系统性误差。</p>\n<h3 id=\"反射式测光-vs-入射式测光\">反射式测光 vs 入射式测光</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>工作原理</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>反射式</td>\n<td>测量从物体反射的光</td>\n<td>相机内置、方便</td>\n<td>受被摄体反射率影响</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>入射式</td>\n<td>测量到达被摄体的光</td>\n<td>不受反射率影响</td>\n<td>需要独立设备、靠近被摄体</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>相机内置的测光系统均为反射式——它测的是&quot;物体看起来有多亮&quot;，而不是&quot;照在物体上的光有多强&quot;。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"矩阵测光-matrix-evaluative-metering\">矩阵测光（Matrix / Evaluative Metering）</h2><h3 id=\"工作原理\">工作原理</h3><p>矩阵测光将画面划分为多个区域（现代相机 1000–30,000+ 区域），分别测量每个区域的亮度，然后通过复杂的算法决定最终曝光：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>场景分区亮度检测</li>\n<li>对焦点位置加权（假设主体在对焦区域）</li>\n<li>色彩信息分析（天空蓝 → 可能是户外高反差场景）</li>\n<li>数据库匹配（与数万张已知场景的曝光数据对比）</li>\n<li>计算最终曝光值</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"现代-ai-测光\">现代 AI 测光</h3><p>2025—2026 年旗舰相机引入了深度学习测光：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>厂商</th>\n<th>技术名称</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Sony</td>\n<td>Real-time Eye AF + AE</td>\n<td>基于人脸/眼睛位置加权</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Canon</td>\n<td>iTR AF X + Smart AE</td>\n<td>场景识别优化曝光</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Nikon</td>\n<td>3D Matrix Metering III</td>\n<td>利用 RGB+IR 传感器</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"矩阵测光的优缺点\">矩阵测光的优缺点</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>适应大多数场景</td>\n<td>高反差场景可能折中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拍摄速度快</td>\n<td>&quot;黑箱&quot;算法不可预测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>新手友好</td>\n<td>逆光/舞台/雪地可能失准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不断学习进化</td>\n<td>创意曝光受限</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"中央重点测光-center-weighted-metering\">中央重点测光（Center-Weighted Metering）</h2><h3 id=\"工作原理\">工作原理</h3><p>以画面中央区域（直径约 8–15mm 的圆形）为主要测光依据，边缘区域的贡献递减。典型权重分布：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>中央区域：60%–80% 权重</li>\n<li>边缘区域：20%–40% 权重</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"适用场景\">适用场景</h3><ul>\n<li>主体位于画面中央的人像摄影</li>\n<li>需要可预测、一致的测光结果</li>\n<li>连拍中需要曝光稳定（不因构图微调而跳变）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"与矩阵测光的差异\">与矩阵测光的差异</h3><p>中央重点测光的行为更&quot;可预测&quot;——结果主要取决于中央区域的亮度，不会因为边缘进入一片亮区或暗区而大幅跳变。这在需要连续稳定曝光的视频拍摄中尤为有用。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"点测光-spot-metering\">点测光（Spot Metering）</h2><h3 id=\"工作原理\">工作原理</h3><p>只测量画面中极小区域（通常 1%–5% 面积，对应对焦点附近）的亮度。测光结果完全取决于这个小区域。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mfrac><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mi>K</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">EV_{spot} = \\log_2\\frac{L_{spot}}{K}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 为校准常数（约 12.5 cd/m²）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"zone-system-应用\">Zone System 应用</h3><p>Ansel Adams 的区域系统（Zone System）将亮度分为 11 个区域（Zone 0–X），Zone V 对应 18% 灰：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Zone</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>反射率</th>\n<th>EV 偏移</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>纯黑</td>\n<td>0%</td>\n<td>-5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>III</td>\n<td>暗色有细节</td>\n<td>4.5%</td>\n<td>-2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>V</td>\n<td>18% 中灰</td>\n<td>18%</td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>VII</td>\n<td>亮色有细节</td>\n<td>72%</td>\n<td>+2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>X</td>\n<td>纯白</td>\n<td>100%+</td>\n<td>+5</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>点测光+Zone System 使用方法：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>对关键区域点测光（如皮肤）</li>\n<li>判断该区域应该落在哪个 Zone</li>\n<li>施加对应的曝光补偿</li>\n</ol>\n<p>例：对亚洲人肤色点测光 → 应还原为 Zone VI（偏亮一档）→ +1 EV 补偿。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;Spot Meter&lt;br/&gt;on Subject&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;What Zone&lt;br/&gt;Should It Be?&quot;}&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;Dark Skin = Zone V&quot;| C[&quot;+0 EV&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;Light Skin = Zone VI&quot;| D[&quot;+1 EV&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;White Dress = Zone VII&quot;| E[&quot;+2 EV&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;Black Suit = Zone III&quot;| F[&quot;-2 EV&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"Spot Meter&lt;br/&gt;on Subject\"] --&gt; B{\"What Zone&lt;br/&gt;Should It Be?\"}\n    B --&gt;|\"Dark Skin = Zone V\"| C[\"+0 EV\"]\n    B --&gt;|\"Light Skin = Zone VI\"| D[\"+1 EV\"]\n    B --&gt;|\"White Dress = Zone VII\"| E[\"+2 EV\"]\n    B --&gt;|\"Black Suit = Zone III\"| F[\"-2 EV\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"高光加权测光-highlight-weighted-metering\">高光加权测光（Highlight-Weighted Metering）</h2><h3 id=\"工作原理\">工作原理</h3><p>专门保护高光区域不溢出的测光模式。算法检测画面中最亮的区域，确保这些区域不超过传感器的满阱容量。</p>\n<h3 id=\"适用场景\">适用场景</h3><ul>\n<li>舞台摄影（聚光灯+黑暗背景）</li>\n<li>拍摄白色物体/婚纱</li>\n<li>需要 ETTR 但不想手动判断的场景</li>\n<li>逆光场景中保护天空高光</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"测光与-ae-lock\">测光与 AE Lock</h2><h3 id=\"ae-l-自动曝光锁定\">AE-L（自动曝光锁定）</h3><p>当需要先测光再构图时，AE-L 允许锁定当前测光值：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>将测光区域对准主体 → 半按快门或按 AE-L</li>\n<li>重新构图</li>\n<li>完全按下快门</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"曝光补偿-vs-ae-l\">曝光补偿 vs AE-L</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>持续性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>曝光补偿</td>\n<td>整批拍摄需要偏亮/偏暗</td>\n<td>持续到手动归零</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AE-L</td>\n<td>单张测光后重新构图</td>\n<td>单次有效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>手动模式</td>\n<td>完全控制曝光</td>\n<td>完全手动</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"包围曝光-exposure-bracketing\">包围曝光（Exposure Bracketing）</h2><h3 id=\"原理\">原理</h3><p>以当前测光值为中心，自动拍摄多张不同曝光的照片：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>E</mi><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>n</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">EV_i = EV_{center} + \\Delta \\cdot i, \\quad i = -n, \\ldots, 0, \\ldots, +n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ce</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>常用设置：±1 EV × 3 张 或 ±2 EV × 5 张。</p>\n<h3 id=\"应用\">应用</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>HDR 合成</strong>：将多张包围曝光合并为高动态范围图像</li>\n<li><strong>曝光保险</strong>：在不确定的光线条件下确保至少一张正确</li>\n<li><strong>Focus Stacking 辅助</strong>：某些场景同时需要曝光和焦点包围</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>包围范围</th>\n<th>张数</th>\n<th>合成 DR 增益</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>±1 EV</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>+2 stops</td>\n<td>一般 HDR</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>±2 EV</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>+4 stops</td>\n<td>高反差场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>±2 EV</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>+4 stops</td>\n<td>更平滑过渡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>±3 EV</td>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>+6 stops</td>\n<td>极端 HDR</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"本章小结\">本章小结</h2><p>测光是将物理光量转化为曝光决策的桥梁。矩阵测光覆盖 80% 的日常场景，但在高反差、特殊反射率的条件下需要手动介入——点测光+Zone System 思维是最精确的手动测光方法。理解每种测光模式的算法逻辑和假设条件，你就能预判它何时会失准，并提前做出正确的曝光补偿。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"测光模式","id":"测光模式"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"测光的物理基础","id":"测光的物理基础"},{"level":3,"text":"18% 灰——测光基准","id":"18-灰-测光基准"},{"level":3,"text":"反射式测光 vs 入射式测光","id":"反射式测光-vs-入射式测光"},{"level":2,"text":"矩阵测光（Matrix / Evaluative Metering）","id":"矩阵测光-matrix-evaluative-metering"},{"level":3,"text":"工作原理","id":"工作原理"},{"level":3,"text":"现代 AI 测光","id":"现代-ai-测光"},{"level":3,"text":"矩阵测光的优缺点","id":"矩阵测光的优缺点"},{"level":2,"text":"中央重点测光（Center-Weighted Metering）","id":"中央重点测光-center-weighted-metering"},{"level":3,"text":"工作原理","id":"工作原理"},{"level":3,"text":"适用场景","id":"适用场景"},{"level":3,"text":"与矩阵测光的差异","id":"与矩阵测光的差异"},{"level":2,"text":"点测光（Spot Metering）","id":"点测光-spot-metering"},{"level":3,"text":"工作原理","id":"工作原理"},{"level":3,"text":"Zone System 应用","id":"zone-system-应用"},{"level":2,"text":"高光加权测光（Highlight-Weighted Metering）","id":"高光加权测光-highlight-weighted-metering"},{"level":3,"text":"工作原理","id":"工作原理"},{"level":3,"text":"适用场景","id":"适用场景"},{"level":2,"text":"测光与 AE Lock","id":"测光与-ae-lock"},{"level":3,"text":"AE-L（自动曝光锁定）","id":"ae-l-自动曝光锁定"},{"level":3,"text":"曝光补偿 vs AE-L","id":"曝光补偿-vs-ae-l"},{"level":2,"text":"包围曝光（Exposure Bracketing）","id":"包围曝光-exposure-bracketing"},{"level":3,"text":"原理","id":"原理"},{"level":3,"text":"应用","id":"应用"},{"level":2,"text":"本章小结","id":"本章小结"}],"prev":{"title":"曝光三角","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/optics-basics/exposure-system/exposure-triangle"},"next":{"title":"动态范围","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/optics-basics/exposure-system/dynamic-range"}}